{"id":"vod_sn_37037","vodId":"37037","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"圣母在上","name_cn":"圣母在上","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/d6380d610718548f936aab04d5d4577b.jpg"},"summary":"在私立莉莉安女子学院里，有着这样一个制度，新入校的学生要选择一位高年级的学姐，两人结为“姐妹”，在校学习的期间，姐姐将全方位的照顾教导妹妹的生活礼仪。在学院里，山百合会的名字如雷贯耳，作为会长的小笠原祥子（伊藤美纪 配音）、鸟居江利子（生天目仁美 配音）和佐藤圣（封口惠美 配音）三人更是学院里女生们倾慕的对象。她们被称为学院的三朵蔷薇，平日里，她们和她们的妹妹，也就是蔷薇花蕾管理着学生会里的大小事宜。　　平凡的少女福泽佑巳（植田佳奈 配音）在误打误撞中成为了祥子的蔷薇花蕾，同时也肩负起了管理山百合会的重任。在和其他花蕾相处的过程中，又温馨又轻松的校园生活开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:48:14","playable":true,"episodeCount":20,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wrKVFkh96B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7jZzdVwSED1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qJenNbr0cH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SJ08bNnbk21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Q9fJnnMKna1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vpdJPHqGi61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cZMmJXt0Vu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ew4jmMW1UN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ea5EeR1vSU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/urnvh33Q5K1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/L2WDEzA9ae1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/n2YKakRNJk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5yuVaMqaCz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YnjqB3uPJq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","ur